<div class="text guide-styles" data-units-dynamic="article" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Paladin Tank in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h2>While we wish to give users a comprehensive look into their pre-raid gearing, the truth of the matter is that in Phase 4 and with how powerful (and accessible) the catch-up gear has become, listing long outdated dungeon drops, or even alternatives is moot. As such for Phase 4 we have curated most item slots down to the bare essentials as we feel this represents the most accurate &amp; relevant progression path for most users. As such don't be alarmed if certain esoteric pieces do not make the list, especially if there are easy to obtain alternatives that we think you should focus on, such as PvP/<wbr/>Justice Points/<wbr/>Crafted (non raid mats), and reputation rewards. The latter especially is something we will always consider an "easy" to pick up piece unless that reputation is very grindy or an otherwise impediment.<br/>
<br/>
