<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="justice-points">Justice Points for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>All former Valor Point gear from phase 3 is now made available to us for JP, while it's not our main mode of gearing this phase you can use excess JP to bulk out your set as you go. We're not going to be exhaustive because a) the listing itself is arbitrary and b) it gets really long and silly. Really you should buy items in slots where your upgrade is the highest impact, if unsure go by item level.<br/>
<br/>
