<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="obsidian-fragment">Obsidian Fragments for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>Those that geared last phase or in WotLK will remember that each phase came with its own dungeon oriented catch-up gear mechanic and this is no different, mirroring the Stone Fissures from last phase. This time, the gear is primarily not last tiers' hand me downs but rather this is how you acquire the formerly LFR (Looking For Raid) gear. Blizzard has done away with this raid difficulty for phase 4 and decided to award us the gear through this instead.<br/>
<br/>Following the logic we use on JP here and keep in mind that this is not a hard <b>list</b> per se but we do recommend that you target farm your tier pieces, for either 4piece or 2piece-2piece.<br/>
<br/>
