<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Hands for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>We pick up the tier gloves here, though while there are alternatives we suggest that you prime your set with 3-set prot to make it easier to slot in an additional piece for the 4-set bonus on demand. It's worth noting that this is not a high priority piece and you can delay this if you find alternatives.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Glove Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82177/quickflip-deflection-plates">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quickflip Deflection Plates</span></a> &amp; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74132/enchant-gloves-mastery">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Mastery</span></a></div>
