<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Legs for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>This is a good place to briefly discuss the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=105765/item-paladin-t13-retribution-2p-bonus-judgement">ret set 2-set bonus</a>. While this set bonus have neglible tanking potential, the strength in the bonus lie primarily in how much it helps patch over your rotation and reduce unwanted RNG. It's completely optional ofcourse, being ultimately a DPS steroid even if it does have tertiary tanking benefits.<br/>
<br/>The legs themselves are however a prime mover in the equation being very competitively statted, it would've been much harder to recommend this set bonus without them.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Leg Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
<img alt="Drakehide Leg Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cataclysmarmorkit_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Armor</span></a>. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">Leatherworkers</a> can make their own <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=101600/drakehide-leg-reinforcements">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drakehide Leg Reinforcements</span></a>.</div>
