<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Trinkets for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>We actually access a pair of fairly reliable trinkets this phase. While your initial reaction may be that they're very situational because <i>how often am I actually close to dying</i>, they offer one of the most reliable EHP boosts, technically on demand. While they effects are not as surgical as we might personally want, you can layer them for some good protection.<div class="pad"></div>
